Z||000006||theogre||10-23-2001||08:05 PM||||Read the serpent belt article in the engine section of my cave.<P>Could be the belt, the tensioner, or anything the belt runs.<P>The belt tensioner is only available from a GM/Pontiac/etc dealer.<P>Try to find a Gates belt for it. Dayco simply doesn't last. I have to replace Dayco every 18 months. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
